  91:BSP/u8g2/u8x8_debounce.c ****     u8x8->debounce_last_pin_state == current_state 
  92:BSP/u8g2/u8x8_debounce.c ****       --> keypress detected
  93:BSP/u8g2/u8x8_debounce.c ****       --> State C
  94:BSP/u8g2/u8x8_debounce.c ****     u8x8->debounce_last_pin_state != current_state 
